{"4885880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sky Scramble", "steam_appid": 4885880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sky Scramble</strong> is the local multiplayer dogfighting brawler your living room deserves, and your friendships don't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the timeless chaos of <strong>Biplane Duel</strong> and <strong>Squadron Scramble</strong>, Sky Scramble throws up to 4 players into a free-for-all across three eras of glorious aviation history - strap in, take off, and immediately shoot your best mate out of the sky. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885880/extras/7196af6c67786416bc1b00860cb72f6a.poster.avif?t=1788355207\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885880/extras/7196af6c67786416bc1b00860cb72f6a.webm?t=1788355207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885880/extras/7196af6c67786416bc1b00860cb72f6a.mp4?t=1788355207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THREE ERAS. ONE VENDETTA.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong> — Flimsy biplanes, weak engines, but the purest duelling - don't stall!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WW2</strong> — Spitfires, dogfights, and a level of pettiness the history books left out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jet Age</strong> — Go fast &amp; loud</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EJECTOR SEATS</strong> Think you won? Think again. Your freshly-exploded opponent just bailed out, parachuted to the ground, and is now sprinting across the tarmac with a pistol. You'd better finish the job before they get back to their hangar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885880/extras/94167dc55507cfd78bc37e46698732e0.poster.avif?t=1788355207\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885880/extras/94167dc55507cfd78bc37e46698732e0.webm?t=1788355207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885880/extras/94167dc55507cfd78bc37e46698732e0.mp4?t=1788355207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players, one screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three eras of air combat, each with distinct planes and feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ejector seats: because one death isn't embarrassing enough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 hand-crafted levels from England to Japan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots to practice against</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller &amp; Steam Deck support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remote Play Together: Can't get together - no problem, Steam has you covered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Achievements to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possibly a hidden level, who knows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885880/extras/9e6d34f67a9a3e74676e69f160d86855.poster.avif?t=1788355207\" width=780 height=30